"title":"On-page videos","color":"#4ECDC4","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-1-0","title":"What do H1 mean?","status":"status-2","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-1-0-0","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"https://www.loom.com/share/b404190d6885462a8288391c0f037f9c?sid=036c19f1-e20f-4e97-b89c-7765192f2c59","timestamp":"2024-08-27T15:03:23","avatar":""}]}]},{"id":"group-9-2","title":"Google Search Console","color":"#45B7D1","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-2-0","title":"GSC Coverage","status":"status-2","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-2-0-0","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"GSC Coverage Issue Part 1GSC Coverage Issue Part 2","timestamp":"2024-08-15T13:25:53","avatar":""}]}]},{"id":"group-9-3","title":"Monday update style","color":"#FFA07A","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-3-0","title":"Meta titles and description format","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-3-0-0","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"Meta Titles & Descriptions Task Flow:  Assignee:  MUST COMPLETE THESE PARTS BEFORE CONTENT AUDIT  Echo Generation  ○ No duplicate URLs before generation  > ○ Generate all meta titles and descriptions from Echo export.  Transferred to  >  ○ Worksheet  ○ Client File  Fixed File (Google Sheet)  > ○ Worksheet file name Ex: Worksheet: [Business name]  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  > ● Column headers: Page URL, Meta Title, Meta Description, Character Count (Title), Character Count (Description), Status. ○ Client file name (Client file: [Business name])  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  > ○ Column headers: Page URL, Meta Title, Meta Description, Character Count (Title), Character Count (Description), Status.  File Attachment:  >  ○ Worksheet attached on Monday  ○ Client File attached on Monday  CAN PROCEED TO THIS ONCE TOP SECTION IS DONE  Quality Audit  >* Complete: ○ Meta Title: 40–55 characters.  ○ Meta Description: 140–155 characters.  ○ Ensure phrasing is keyword-optimised and natural  ○ Branding (Business name) included for product/service pages  ○ Blog URLs (Title topic-focused instead of branding-focused)  ○ No Duplicates  ○ Webpage Content accurate  ○ Formatting issues (business name inclusions and Spellings (British or American) ○ Must be linked to the Management Sheet  > ○ For client file: Should only be the past & current month of work that should be present on the file. (IMPORTANT)  ○ File reviewed, formatted, and approved for upload.  >* Ongoing Fix: ○ Fixing character count  ○ Checking for duplicate content  ○ Checking for content alignment  ○ Putting the branding name for the service/product page  ○ Checking blog URL title/description relevance  Additional Updates:","timestamp":"2025-11-06T15:44:11","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-9-3-1","title":"Cluster Article Format","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-9-3-1-0","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"CLUSTER ARTICLES WORKFLOW:  Assignee:  Monday task name:  > ● Cluster – [number of articles per month] article generation [Month]  EX: Cluster – 50 article generation (Nov)  1. BEFORE YOU START CONTENT AUDIT (Must clear these)  Title topic Generation (Must meet these requirements)  >  ● Informational  ● Educational  ● Commercial  ● Transactional  ● Seasonal (Depends)  ● Target’s client’s market location  Echo Generation  > ● Generate articles from Echo export.  Transferred to  >  ● Worksheet  ● Client File  Fixed File (Google Sheet)  > ○ Worksheet file name (Worksheet: [Business name])  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  ○ Set up the tab name as Cluster article batch [number] [month]  > ○ Column headers: Title topics and category included, Keyword 1 & 2 and Links  ○ Client file name (Client file: [Business name])  > ○ No extra cells or columns.  > ○ Orange header with white text.  > ○ Neat and properly aligned formatting.  ○ Column headers: Title topics and category included, Keyword 1 & 2 and Links  ○ Set up the tab name as Cluster article batch [number] [month]  > ○ Keywords 1 and 2 are present in the file  ○ NO keyword repeats across the sheet  File Attachment:  >  ● Worksheet attached on Monday  ● Client File attached on Monday  2. COMMON MISTAKES WHEN AUDITING (review these before doing content audit)  Article Standards  > ○ Articles have proper keyword distribution, from title (high relevance to title and article data)  ○ Primary Keyword from title (high relevance to title and article data) - 3-5x in body only (metadata separate: 1-2x)  > ○ Secondary Keywords (topically relevant from article) - 2-4x each in body only  > ○ Distribute keywords: intro, body, H3s, conclusion  ○ Ensure phrasing is natural and keyword-optimised  ○ The article should align with the client's core service functions and also be topic-focused ○ AI text construction should be below 40%  Internal Linking Strategy Standards  > ● Vary position across cluster articles  ● Homepage (Note: Must be on Business name) entry points (Linked: 1-3x only)  ● Contact page in the CONCLUSION section (Linked: 1x only)  ● No “Page” word on interlinks  ● Vary service page distribution  ● Vary anchor text (no repeats across cluster)  ● No service URL Linked more than 1-2x per article  ● No link positions/location across articles  ● Natural interlinking (No forced interlink)  3. QUALITY AUDIT STATUS  Technical Formatting  Outline:  > ○ Title must have the word \"Outline\", Ex: Outline: Cluster Article Workflow  > ○ Proper heading structure (Title H1, Main headings H2, Subheadings H3s)  ○ Clean formatting alignment  ○ Proper metadata setup  Article:  > ○ Proper heading structure (Title H1, Main headings H2, Subheadings H3s)  ○ Clean formatting alignment  ○ Proper metadata setup  For Complete Status (Must meet these):  > ○ No duplicate keywords Google sheet  ○ No repeated linking patterns  ○ No service URL duplicates more than 2x within an article  ○ Word counts and formatting correct (2K – 3K words)  ○ Content alignment verified  ○ No AI generic texts (Refer to QA prompt Guidelines)  ○ Outlines are present ○ Must be linked to the Management sheet ○ FOR CLIENT FILE: Should only be the past & current month of work that should be present in the file. (IMPORTANT)  Ongoing:  >  ○ Fixing AI generic texts  ○ Keyword distribution  ○ Keyword enforcement  ○ Interlinking Issues  ○ HTML code issues with interlinks  ○ Headings Formatting Issues  Additional Updates:","timestamp":"2025-11-06T17:16:55","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-9-3-2","title":"Keyword Research update format","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]},{"id":"group-9-4","title":"Planning and Research videos","color":"#98D8C8","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-4-0","title":"Competitor Mapping","status":"status-2","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":"f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]},{"id":"group-9-5","title":"New Group","color":"#FF8B94","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-5-0","title":"What is SEO \\","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":null,"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]},{"id":"group-9-6","title":"Need Video Tutorials Tasks","color":"#FF6B6B","tasks":[{"id":"task-9-6-0","title":"competitor mapping","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-9-6-1","title":"seo optimise target pages","status":"","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]}],"statusDefs":[{"id":"status-1","label":"To Do","color":"#C4C4C4"},{"id":"status-2","label":"Working on it","color":"#FDAB3D"},{"id":"status-3","label":"Review","color":"#A25DDC"},{"id":"status-4","label":"QA","color":"#9CD326"},{"id":"status-5","label":"Ben To Check","color":"#00C875"},{"id":"status-6","label":"Sent To Client","color":"#579BFC"},{"id":"status-7","label":"Revisions Required","color":"#E44258"},{"id":"status-8","label":"Done","color":"#00D084"}],"priorityDefs":[{"id":"priority-1","label":"Low","color":"#C4C4C4"},{"id":"priority-2","label":"Medium","color":"#FDAB3D"},{"id":"priority-3","label":"High","color":"#E44258"},{"id":"priority-4","label":"Critical ⚠️️","color":"#FF0000"}]}$$::jsonb);

